  "solution": "Vận tốc và gia tốc của vật tại thời điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>t</mi></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tTại thời điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, vận tốc của vật là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cm/s.<br>Gia tốc của vật là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cm/s<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>.",
